title: "Verification floor Phi: reference implementation and sea-ice archive recomputation"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of the dimensionless verification floor Phi = 2.802 sigma_d / (claim sqrt(n_eff)), the archive recomputation for Arctic sea-ice thickness, and the sensitivity grids behind the accompanying article.
